<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting (Danio rerio (zebrafish shield-stage gastrula germ-layer progenitors: ectoderm, mesoderm, endoderm))",
        "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting faithfully reproduces Danio rerio (zebrafish shield-stage gastrula germ-layer progenitors: ectoderm, mesoderm, endoderm) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Danio rerio (zebrafish shield-stage gastrula germ-layer progenitors: ectoderm, mesoderm, endoderm) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 54.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py> ;
    schema:about "Danio rerio (zebrafish shield-stage gastrula germ-layer progenitors: ectoderm, mesoderm, endoderm)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py; output: docs/media/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting_comparison.png; organism: Danio rerio (zebrafish shield-stage gastrula germ-layer progenitors: ectoderm, mesoderm, endoderm); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 04e6692e5c44347cdef3ff055c0cf966e6a50c079cad3d06d965f070f3683587; artifact_sha256: ae4b7b1f31d4405893da8118cf8a75b83311d09095b152801895b9f7cb84f532" ;
