<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — Code-to-model traceability: 69/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions correspond to DITH tension decomposition and lattice sorting, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean` proves 3 theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Brodland (2002) Eqs. 1-6, Krieg et al. (2008) Figs. 1-4, and Maître et al. (2012) Eq. 1." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
