    pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py L25–L163: Baseline functions lack equation-number mappings to Brodland (2002), Krieg et al. (2008), and Maître et al. (2012) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L25-L163>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-code-traceability-1> ;
