<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — Model fidelity to source: 66/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Brodland's (2002) Eq. (1) DITH interfacial tension formula (`compute_dith_tensions`, L25-63) and simulates wild-type ectoderm/mesoderm engulfment vs Blebbistatin Myosin-II inhibition (`simulate_dith_sorting_v1`, L66-163). However, v1 omits Krieg et al.'s (2008) `caMLCK` cortical stiffening sorting reversal (`beta_E=145 > beta_M=95`), high-HIT partial doublet lens formation, 3-germ-layer (ectoderm/mesoderm/endoderm) concentric sorting, Maître et al.'s (2012) Young-Dupré cell-doublet contact angle law, and microscopic single-spin boundary fluctuations." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py L66–L163: v1 simulates only 2 regimes without caMLCK sorting reversal, 3-germ-layer sorting, or Young-Dupré cell-doublet contact mechanics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L66-L163>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
