<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — MorphoEval overall 54.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py` (57.3/100). The v1 baseline implements the Brodland (2002) DITH interfacial tension relation `gamma_{alpha,beta} = beta_alpha + beta_beta - omega_{alpha,beta}` (`compute_dith_tensions`, L25-63) and simulates 2D cell sorting for wild-type zebrafish ectoderm/mesoderm engulfment (`beta_E=50, beta_M=95`) vs Blebbistatin Myosin-II inhibition (`beta_E=beta_M=25`), but omits Krieg et al.'s (2008) 3-germ-layer concentric hierarchy (ectoderm/mesoderm/endoderm) and `caMLCK` ectodermal cortical stiffening sorting reversal (`beta_{E+caMLCK}=145 > beta_M=95`), omits Maître et al.'s (2012) Young-Dupré cell-doublet contact angle `cos(theta) = 1 - gamma_cc/(2*gamma_cm)` and normalized contact radius `r_c/R = sin(theta)` mechanics, omits microscopic Metropolis membrane boundary fluctuations with volume/perimeter elasticity, does not load or segment the vendored zebrafish blastoderm cross-transplantation fluorescence specimen (`germ_layer_doublet_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.7/100 (faithfulness 49.3, reproducibility 67.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 66, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 46, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 65, Code-to-model traceability 69, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting_comparison.png: rendered output of 2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py at b9976f8, image/png, 45458 B, 1680×560 px, artifact_sha256 ae4b7b1f31d4405893da8118cf8a75b83311d09095b152801895b9f7cb84f532 (sha256 ae4b7b1f31d4405893da8118cf8a75b83311d09095b152801895b9f7cb84f532), spec_fingerprint 04e6692e5c44347cdef3ff055c0cf966e6a50c079cad3d06d965f070f3683587. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 04e6692e5c44347cdef3ff055c0cf966e6a50c079cad3d06d965f070f3683587; artifact_sha256: ae4b7b1f31d4405893da8118cf8a75b83311d09095b152801895b9f7cb84f532." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement Maître et al. (2012) Science Eq. (1) Young-Dupré cell-doublet contact angle `cos(theta) = 1 - gamma_cc/(2*gamma_cm)` and normalized contact radius `r_c/R_cell = sin(theta)` across `gamma_cc/(2*gamma_cm) in [0.15, 1.0]`, plus a 7-point continuous sweep across ectodermal cortical tension `beta_E in {25, 50, 72, 95, 115, 130, 145} pN/um` crossing the sorting inversion point `beta_E = beta_M = 95 pN/um`.",
        "remediation needed: Implement all 4 canonical DITH / Krieg et al. (2008) regimes (`wildtype_germ_layer_engulfment` beta_E=50 < beta_M=95, `camlc_ectoderm_cortex_reversal` beta_{E+caMLCK}=145 > beta_M=95, `blebbistatin_myosin_inhibition` beta_E=beta_M=25, and `high_hit_partial_doublet_lens` gamma_EM=70 > 45) plus 3-germ-layer (ectoderm/mesoderm/endoderm: beta_E=50 < beta_M=95 < beta_N=130 pN/um) concentric sorting and microscopic deformable boundary fluctuations.",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting_reference.json` and `germ_layer_doublet_specimen.jpg`, segment both the Row B layered GFP/RFP zebrafish blastoderm transplant and the Row C protruding mushroom doublet, compare empirical vs. simulated profiles and doublet contact geometry, and expose full CLI parameter flags." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.47e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

